{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"amerikaner-card-game UI copy.fields.summary","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"amerikaner-card-game.copy.fields.summary","keys":["amerikaner-card-game.copy.fields.summary"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"ZXQPH0000QXZ-card deck daya na ɗabi'a, babu jokers. Raba daidai ga 'yan wasa ZXQPH0001QXZ–ZXQPH0002QXZ ta hanyar sanya biyun da suka isa a gefe. Zaɓin da aka saba yana farawa da rabin hannun da aka lulluɓe zuwa sama kuma ya kamata ya zama mafi girman zaɓin da aka yi a baya. Ka kira Amurkawa don ya ɗauki duk canje-canje shi kaɗai. Zaɓin da aka saba, ya jagoranci wajen saita tabbaci kuma ya nemi wata takarda mai haɗin kai. Ka bi tufafi idan ka iya. Kungiyar kowace tana lashe ko kuma ta rasa canje-canje; sauran 'yan wasa suna samun adadin canje-canjensu. Mafi girman sakamako yana lashe idan sakamako ya kai ZXQPH0003QXZ.","record_id":"d21119cb31ca12f7d0dfa3d440fce709de1bfea865067bf18b2d176735c773b6","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":3.42338964462499,"source":"One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"664d651c70685d8a9ceee9910c6ea5b9af9a2a68c57654572c69d1f1c94bfe1d","status":"needs-review","translation":"52-card deck daya na ɗabi'a, babu jokers. Raba daidai ga 'yan wasa 3–6 ta hanyar sanya biyun da suka isa a gefe. Zaɓin da aka saba yana farawa da rabin hannun da aka lulluɓe zuwa sama kuma ya kamata ya zama mafi girman zaɓin da aka yi a baya. Ka kira Amurkawa don ya ɗauki duk canje-canje shi kaɗai. Zaɓin da aka saba, ya jagoranci wajen saita tabbaci kuma ya nemi wata takarda mai haɗin kai. Ka bi tufafi idan ka iya. Kungiyar kowace tana lashe ko kuma ta rasa canje-canje; sauran 'yan wasa suna samun adadin canje-canjensu. Mafi girman sakamako yana lashe idan sakamako ya kai 52.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
